<text font-family="sans-serif" fill="black" x="230" y="230"
      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 28.103 Modified Barion Hexagon</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Steele, Norman W; Unpubl  4-9-89</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Up to step C4 design is meetpoint. Step C6 is the </text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="284">skill facet.  Adjusted to make two meetpoints.</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="302">Angles for R.I. = 1.540</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="320">73 facets + 6 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="338">6-fold, mirror-image symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="356">L/W = 1.155  T/W = 0.566  U/W = 0.552</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="374">P/W = 0.502 C/W = 0.196</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="392">Vol/W&#179; = 0.282</tspan>
